    [2230]={name="Gloves of Brawn",quality=2,ilvl=24,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Elixir of Pain'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Apothecary Lydon in Hillsbrad Foothills. Objective: Bring 10 vials of Mountain Lion Blood to Apothecary Lydon in Tarren Mill.",zone="Hillsbrad Foothills",questName="Elixir of Pain",lore="Oh...the flowers are blooming in Hillsbrad and the air is so fresh and brisk. I can't help but to wallow in the misery of it all. I look out my grimy window and long for the day when our New Plague brings this world the death it deserves."},
    [2240]={name="Rugged Cape",quality=1,ilvl=15,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Crocolisk Hunting'. Starts with Marek Ironheart in Loch Modan. Objective: Get 5 pieces of Crocolisk Meat and 6 Crocolisk Skins for Marek Ironheart at the Farstrider Lodge.",zone="Loch Modan",questName="Crocolisk Hunting",lore="Many a hunter is attracted to Loch Modan to hunt our famous crocs. There are always merchants who seek out crocolisk skins for clothing items or armor, and there are also some who enjoy the taste of their meat."},
