    [6659]={name="Scarab Trousers",quality=2,ilvl=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Escape Through Stealth'. Starts with Volcor in Darkshore. Objective: Escape the Furbolg cave and meet Terenthis in Auberdine.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Escape Through Stealth",lore="All right then... if you're sure, we'll sneak out of here. Let us leave when you're ready. Remember, after you've escaped, meet Terenthis back in Auberdine."},
    [6664]={name="Voodoo Mantle",quality=2,ilvl=26,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Jin'Zil's Forest Magic'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Witch Doctor Jin'Zil in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Witch Doctor Jin'Zil at Malaka'jin wants 5 portions of Stonetalon Sap, 5 Twilight Whiskers, 30 Courser Eyes and a Fey Dragon Scale.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Jin'Zil's Forest Magic",lore="So excited I am! Three little cages for three little elves! But what shall we do with our lovely tree-hugging friends? Why, let's give them a taste of..."},
    [6665]={name="Hexed Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=26,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Jin'Zil's Forest Magic'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Witch Doctor Jin'Zil in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Witch Doctor Jin'Zil at Malaka'jin wants 5 portions of Stonetalon Sap, 5 Twilight Whiskers, 30 Courser Eyes and a Fey Dragon Scale.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Jin'Zil's Forest Magic",lore="So excited I am! Three little cages for three little elves! But what shall we do with our lovely tree-hugging friends? Why, let's give them a taste of..."},
    [6666]={name="Dredge Boots",quality=2,ilvl=22,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gerenzo's Orders'. Starts with Piznik in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Get the mysterious ore from Piznik after he finishes mining it.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Gerenzo's Orders",lore="I guess I'd better think about getting out of here, also. It won't take long for word of what happened here to spread to the higher ups, and I'm sure they wouldn't take too kindly to meeting me again."},
    [6667]={name="Engineer's Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=27,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Ziz Fizziks in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Bring Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle's Mechanical Arm to Ziz Fizziks in the Stonetalon Mountains.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle",lore="I met Gerenzo once, but let me tell you, he's not easy on the eyes. His flesh looks like it's rotting away, and he's grafted metal and gears onto his body, replaced some of his limbs with mechanical ones."},
    [6668]={name="Draftsman Boots",quality=2,ilvl=27,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Ziz Fizziks in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Bring Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle's Mechanical Arm to Ziz Fizziks in the Stonetalon Mountains.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle",lore="I met Gerenzo once, but let me tell you, he's not easy on the eyes. His flesh looks like it's rotting away, and he's grafted metal and gears onto his body, replaced some of his limbs with mechanical ones."},
    [6669]={name="Sacred Band",quality=2,ilvl=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Den'. Starts with Braelyn Firehand in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Travel to the Den on Stonetalon Peak. Using the Gatekeeper's Key, obtain the druids' hidden items. Use these items to open the Talon Den Hoard.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="The Den",lore="The druids built the Talon Den on Stonetalon Peak, where they keep many powerful items. They devised a complex scheme to keep them from falling into the wrong hands."},
    [6671]={name="Juggernaut Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=27,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Den'. Starts with Braelyn Firehand in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Travel to the Den on Stonetalon Peak. Using the Gatekeeper's Key, obtain the druids' hidden items. Use these items to open the Talon Den Hoard.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="The Den",lore="The druids built the Talon Den on Stonetalon Peak, where they keep many powerful items. They devised a complex scheme to keep them from falling into the wrong hands."},
    [6675]={name="Tempered Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=27,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Reclaiming the Charred Vale'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Keeper Albagorm in Feralas. Objective: Travel to Falfindel Waywarder on the border of Thousand Needles and Feralas.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Reclaiming the Charred Vale",lore="The Bloodfuries have been subdued. But they will regroup soon enough if action is not taken. Far south of the Barrens lies a land known as Thousand Needles."},
    [6676]={name="Constable Buckler",quality=2,ilvl=27,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Reclaiming the Charred Vale'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Keeper Albagorm in Feralas. Objective: Travel to Falfindel Waywarder on the border of Thousand Needles and Feralas.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Reclaiming the Charred Vale",lore="The Bloodfuries have been subdued. But they will regroup soon enough if action is not taken. Far south of the Barrens lies a land known as Thousand Needles."},
    [6678]={name="Band of Elven Grace",quality=2,ilvl=28,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Reception from Tyrande'. Starts with Sentinel Thenysil in Darnassus. Objective: Find Tyrande Whisperwind in Darnassus.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Reception from Tyrande",lore="I am sure Tyrande Whisperwind herself would like to thank you for taking part in this mission. It may not appear so on the surface, but what you've helped start could very well strengthen our foothold in the Stonetalon Mountains."},
    [6709]={name="Moonglow Vest",quality=2,ilvl=18,reqLevel=13,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 1).",profession="Leatherworking"},
    [6719]={name="Windborne Belt",quality=2,ilvl=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Highperch Venom'. Starts with Fiora Longears in Dustwallow Marsh. Objective: Bring 10 Highperch Venom Sacs to Fiora Longears in Theramore.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Highperch Venom",lore="As you may know, wyverns are often tamed by orcs for use as mounts. But what is less known is that the venom of a wyvern, in some circles, is more valuable than the beast itself."},
    [6720]={name="Spirit Hunter Headdress",quality=2,ilvl=37,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Frostmaw'. Starts with Melor Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff. Objective: Bring Frostmaw's Mane to Melor Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff.",zone="Thunder Bluff",questName="Frostmaw",lore="it is now time for you to travel to far-off lands. You are ready. You now hunt Frostmaw, a yeti in the Alterac Mountains. He is elusive, his white coat blending into the snows of his mountain home."},
    [6721]={name="Chestplate of Kor",quality=2,ilvl=24,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Supplies to Auberdine'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Feero Ironhand in Ashenvale. Objective: Speak with Delgren the Purifier at Maestra's Post after seeing Feero safely through Ashenvale Forest.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Supplies to Auberdine",lore="Delgren has asked me to deliver messages and supplies to Sentinel Starbreeze in Auberdine, but I am loathe to leave on my own."},
    [6722]={name="Beastial Manacles",quality=2,ilvl=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Fallen Sky Lake'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Pelturas Whitemoon in Ashenvale. Objective: Retrieve a Fallen Moonstone from the Shadethicket Oracle, then bring it to Pelturas in Astranaar.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Fallen Sky Lake",lore="Relara's fever has passed, but she is still very weak. I do not believe time alone will give her back the strength she has lost. I believe it will take the power of a moonstone."},
    [6726]={name="Razzeric's Customized Seatbelt",quality=2,ilvl=41,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Safety First'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Shreev in Thousand Needles. Objective: Return the Modified Seaforium Booster to Razzeric on the Shimmering Flats.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Safety First",lore="There, I did what Razzeric wanted. Just tell him to be careful when he sets this off. If he makes the slightest mistake, he won't be moving forward, he'll just be a burnt spot on the track."},
    [6727]={name="Razzeric's Racing Grips",quality=2,ilvl=41,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Safety First'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Shreev in Thousand Needles. Objective: Return the Modified Seaforium Booster to Razzeric on the Shimmering Flats.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Safety First",lore="There, I did what Razzeric wanted. Just tell him to be careful when he sets this off. If he makes the slightest mistake, he won't be moving forward, he'll just be a burnt spot on the track."},
    [6730]={name="Ironforge Chain",quality=2,ilvl=16,reqLevel=11,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Blacksmithing (requires skill 1).",profession="Blacksmithing"},
    [6731]={name="Ironforge Breastplate",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=15,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Blacksmithing (requires skill 1).",profession="Blacksmithing"},
    [6732]={name="Gnomish Mechanic's Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=38,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'News for Fizzle'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Martek the Exiled in Thousand Needles. Objective: Speak with Fizzle Brassbolts in the Shimmering Flats.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="News for Fizzle",lore="Indurium has an amazing resistance to heat! I'm sure it will work for Fizzle's pistons. But he'll need true indurium ore, not just the flakes."},
    [6733]={name="Ironforge Gauntlets",quality=2,ilvl=28,reqLevel=23,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Blacksmithing (requires skill 1).",profession="Blacksmithing"},
    [6740]={name="Azure Sash",quality=2,ilvl=29,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Sacred Flame'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Rau Cliffrunner in Thousand Needles. Objective: Retrieve the Cloven Hoof for Rau Cliffrunner at the Freewind Post.",zone="Thunder Bluff",questName="The Sacred Flame",lore="Using the water you brought, you will be able to temporarily douse the flame that holds the centaur relic. It will not work permanently, however, so you will have to be quick about it."},
    [6743]={name="Sustaining Ring",quality=2,ilvl=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Knowledge in the Deeps'. Starts with Gerrig Bonegrip in Ironforge. Objective: Bring the Lorgalis Manuscript to Gerrig Bonegrip in the Forlorn Cavern in Ironforge.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",questName="Knowledge in the Deeps",lore="As you might know, I collect lore. Old lore. Powerful lore. Lore that opens doorways, and lore that can awaken Those Who Sleep."},
    [6745]={name="Swiftrunner Cape",quality=2,ilvl=33,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Alliance Relations'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Takata Steelblade in Orgrimmar. Objective: Speak to Keldran in Orgrimmar.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="Alliance Relations",lore="The fight goes well. Perhaps the Warchief will allow us to return to our homes before the seasons change if we continue to make such great strides in our battle against the demons and their underlings."},
    [6746]={name="Basalt Buckler",quality=2,ilvl=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Corrupter'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Takata Steelblade in Desolace. Objective: Slay Lord Azrethoc and Jugkar Grim'rod and return to Takata Steelblade in Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="The Corrupter",lore="Although I have no knowledge of this Lord Azrethoc, I agree with Maurin, he must be stopped; especially if he is attempting to gain influence over the Burning Blade to further his goals."},
    [6747]={name="Enforcer Pauldrons",quality=2,ilvl=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Corrupter'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Takata Steelblade in Desolace. Objective: Slay Lord Azrethoc and Jugkar Grim'rod and return to Takata Steelblade in Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="The Corrupter",lore="Although I have no knowledge of this Lord Azrethoc, I agree with Maurin, he must be stopped; especially if he is attempting to gain influence over the Burning Blade to further his goals."},
    [6757]={name="Jaina's Signet Ring",quality=2,ilvl=38,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Missing Diplomat'. Starts with Tapoke \\\"Slim\\\" Jahn in Wetlands. Objective: Speak to Mikhail in the Wetlands.",zone="Stormwind City",questName="The Missing Diplomat"},
    [6773]={name="Gelkis Marauder Chain",quality=2,ilvl=42,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Khan Hratha'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Uthek the Wise in Desolace. Objective: Maintain your reputation with the Gelkis, and bring the Maraudine Key Fragment to Uthek the Wise in the Gelkis Village.",zone="Desolace",questName="Khan Hratha",lore="you helped us against the Magram. Now, help us beat the Maraudine! Kill the head of their clan, Khan Hratha! To face him, blow the Maraudine War Horn."},
    [6774]={name="Uthek's Finger",quality=2,ilvl=42,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Khan Hratha'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Uthek the Wise in Desolace. Objective: Maintain your reputation with the Gelkis, and bring the Maraudine Key Fragment to Uthek the Wise in the Gelkis Village.",zone="Desolace",questName="Khan Hratha",lore="you helped us against the Magram. Now, help us beat the Maraudine! Kill the head of their clan, Khan Hratha! To face him, blow the Maraudine War Horn."},
    [6780]={name="Lilac Sash",quality=2,ilvl=36,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Centaur Bounty'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Corporal Melkins in Desolace. Objective: Bring 15 Centaur Ears to Corporal Melkins at Nijel's Point in Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="Centaur Bounty",lore="Now that you scared the centaur clans, it's time to bleed them. When traveling Desolace, hunt centaur. I don't care which clan you hunt. Just gather ears."},
    [6784]={name="Braced Handguards",quality=2,ilvl=36,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Centaur Bounty'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Corporal Melkins in Desolace. Objective: Bring 15 Centaur Ears to Corporal Melkins at Nijel's Point in Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="Centaur Bounty",lore="Now that you scared the centaur clans, it's time to bleed them. When traveling Desolace, hunt centaur. I don't care which clan you hunt. Just gather ears."},
    [6788]={name="Magram Hunter's Belt",quality=2,ilvl=42,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Khan Hratha'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Uthek the Wise in Desolace. Objective: Maintain your reputation with the Gelkis, and bring the Maraudine Key Fragment to Uthek the Wise in the Gelkis Village.",zone="Desolace",questName="Khan Hratha",lore="The Gelkis Khan is dead, and now the Maraudine will fall! Kill the Maraudine Khan, Hratha! To face him, blow the horn on the high bluff in the Valley of Spears."},
    [6789]={name="Ceremonial Centaur Blanket",quality=2,ilvl=42,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Khan Hratha'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Uthek the Wise in Desolace. Objective: Maintain your reputation with the Gelkis, and bring the Maraudine Key Fragment to Uthek the Wise in the Gelkis Village.",zone="Desolace",questName="Khan Hratha",lore="But to blow the horn, you need a mouthpiece. To get a mouthpiece, kill Maraudine centaur."},
    [6792]={name="Sanguine Pauldrons",quality=2,ilvl=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Karnitol Shipwreck'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Desolace. Objective: Return to Kreldig Ungor in Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="The Karnitol Shipwreck",lore="Take Karnitol's things back to Roetten in Ironforge and he'll pay you for a job well done. Haha, if you're not careful, he's gonna be so pleased with ya that he'll ask you to join us full time."},
    [6793]={name="Auric Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Reagents for Reclaimers Inc.'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Kreldig Ungor in Ironforge. Objective: Bring Leftwitch's Package back to Roetten Stonehammer in Ironforge.",zone="Desolace",questName="Reagents for Reclaimers Inc.",lore="To get paid, you're gonna have to get back to Ironforge and speak to Roetten himself. He'll love getting Leftwitch's package out of the way anyway."},
    [6801]={name="Baroque Apron",quality=2,ilvl=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest '... and Bugs'. Starts with Morgan Stern in Dustwallow Marsh. Objective: Bring 12 Pristine Crawler Legs to Morgan Stern in Theramore.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="... and Bugs",lore="Another component of my new recipe is the shelled leg of a giant crab. And the crabs they have in Dustwallow -- Muckshells they call them -- just won't do!"},
    [6828]={name="Visionary Buckler",quality=2,ilvl=38,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Galen's Escape'. Starts with Galen Goodward in Swamp of Sorrows. Objective: Escort Galen out of danger, then find his camp in the Swamp of Sorrows and open his strongbox.",zone="Swamp of Sorrows",questName="Galen's Escape",lore="Please help! These creatures are going to eat me! Help me out of here, and I'll give you a great treasure! It's in my camp in the swamp north of Stonard, but it's locked in a strongbox that can be opened through a trick that only I know."},
    [6830]={name="Bonebiter",quality=3,ilvl=44,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'In the Name of the Light'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Raleigh the Devout in Scarlet Monastery. Objective: Kill High Inquisitor Whitemane, Scarlet Commander Mograine, Herod, the Scarlet Champion and Houndmaster Loksey and then report back to Raleigh the Devout in Southshore.",zone="Scarlet Monastery",questName="In the Name of the Light",lore="I once served the Scarlet Crusade with honor, loyalty and pride. I believed their cause to be a noble one: to rid Azeroth of the undead."},
    [6834]={name="Black Tuxedo",quality=1,ilvl=1,sourceType="object_drop",instructions="Found in a container.",npc="a container"},
    [6835]={name="Black Tuxedo Pants",quality=1,ilvl=23,sourceType="object_drop",instructions="Found in a container.",npc="a container"},
    [6909]={name="Strike of the Hydra",quality=3,ilvl=31,reqLevel=24,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Aku'mai.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Aku'mai",proc="Chance on hit: Corrosive acid that deals 7 Nature damage every 3 sec and lowers target's armor by 50 for 30 sec."},
    [6911]={name="Moss Cinch",quality=3,ilvl=31,reqLevel=24,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Aku'mai.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Aku'mai"},
    [6953]={name="Verigan's Fist",quality=3,ilvl=31,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Test of Righteousness'. Starts with Jordan Stilwell in Dun Morogh. Objective: Wait for Jordan Stilwell to finish forging a weapon for you.",zone="Dun Morogh",questName="The Test of Righteousness",lore="Why don't we go over to the forge and get started on this? I've been preparing for your arrival for some time, so it shouldn't take long at all."},
    [7000]={name="Heartwood Girdle",quality=2,ilvl=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Twilight Falls'. Starts with Argent Guard Manados in Darnassus. Objective: Bring 10 Twilight Pendants to Argent Guard Manados in Darnassus.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",questName="Twilight Falls",lore="Empowered by the ancient rites of the chaotic Old Gods the members of the Twilight's Hammer strive to bring about the return of their dark patrons and spread death and terror across the world."},
    [7003]={name="Beetle Clasps",quality=3,ilvl=27,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Researching the Corruption'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gershala Nightwhisper in Darkshore. Objective: Gershala Nightwhisper in Auberdine wants 8 Corrupt Brain stems.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",questName="Researching the Corruption",lore="Foolish blood elves toil with demonic magic. Have they not witnessed what happened with the naga and with the satyrs of Kalimdor? I fear that the blood elves will meet a similar deformation."},
    [7049]={name="Truefaith Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=30,reqLevel=25,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Tailoring (requires skill 1).",profession="Tailoring"},
    [7054]={name="Robe of Power",quality=3,ilvl=38,reqLevel=33,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Tailoring (requires skill 1).",profession="Tailoring"},
