    [12049]={name="Splintsteel Armor",quality=2,ilvl=53,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Ribbly Screwspigot'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Yuka Screwspigot in Burning Steppes. Objective: Bring Ribbly's Head to Yuka Screwspigot in the Burning Steppes.",zone="Blackrock Depths",questName="Ribbly Screwspigot",lore="My brother Ribbly has always been a drain to his family, taking our money and wasting it on one scheme after another."},
    [12050]={name="Hazecover Boots",quality=2,ilvl=54,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Little Slime Goes a Long Way'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Laris Geardawdle in Ironforge. Objective: Bring 10 Filled Pure Sample Jars to Laris Geardawdle in Ironforge.If you have trouble finding them, perhaps try to get more clues from Laris.",zone="Ironforge",questName="A Little Slime Goes a Long Way",lore="I'm going to need more samples. But--and I don't know how to put this--they have to be pure samples. I know, I know. \"What does 'pure' mean, Laris?\" I'm not sure."},
    [12051]={name="Brazen Gauntlets",quality=2,ilvl=54,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Little Slime Goes a Long Way'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Laris Geardawdle in Ironforge. Objective: Bring 10 Filled Pure Sample Jars to Laris Geardawdle in Ironforge.If you have trouble finding them, perhaps try to get more clues from Laris.",zone="Ironforge",questName="A Little Slime Goes a Long Way",lore="I'm going to need more samples. But--and I don't know how to put this--they have to be pure samples. I know, I know. \"What does 'pure' mean, Laris?\" I'm not sure."},
