    [21188]={name="Fist of Cenarius",quality=4,ilvl=66,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Champion's Battlegear'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Vargus in Silithus. Objective: Bring 15 Cenarion Combat Badges, 20 Cenarion Logistics Badges, 20 Cenarion Tactical Badges and 1 Mark of Cenarius to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Exalted reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.",zone="Silithus",questName="Champion's Battlegear",lore="The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Cenarion Hold are more than just for show. You'd be wise to hold on to them."},
    [21204]={name="Signet Ring of the Bronze Dragonflight",quality=4,ilvl=75,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Path of the Conqueror'. Starts with Anachronos in Tanaris. Objective: ProgressYou honor my kind, &lt;name&gt;. Strike down the enemies of Kalimdor! Show them what it means to deface the land of eternal starlight.You have earned another enhancement. Hand me your signet ring so that I may bolster its power.",zone="Tanaris",questName="The Path of the Conqueror"},
    [21210]={name="Signet Ring of the Bronze Dragonflight",quality=4,ilvl=80,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Grand Invoker'. Starts with Anachronos in Tanaris. Objective: ProgressNever have I seen such tenacity! The Bronze Flight grants you one final enchantment. The Timeless One himself has requested it so!Hand me your signet ring so that I may make the necessary adjustments.",zone="Tanaris",questName="The Grand Invoker"},
    [21242]={name="Blessed Qiraji War Axe",quality=4,ilvl=79,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Imperial Qiraji Armaments'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Imperial Qiraji Armaments",lore="We have not sat idly by for a millennium. We have watched these beasts feast on their own when they have exhausted their utility. We have listened as they have plotted and schemed to destroy our world."},
    [21268]={name="Blessed Qiraji War Hammer",quality=4,ilvl=79,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Imperial Qiraji Regalia'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Imperial Qiraji Regalia",lore="I speak of Elementium, mortal. Find and bring me Imperial Qiraji Regalia and the toxic element and I shall infuse weapons of great power."},
    [21269]={name="Blessed Qiraji Bulwark",quality=4,ilvl=79,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Imperial Qiraji Armaments'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Imperial Qiraji Armaments",lore="We have not sat idly by for a millennium. We have watched these beasts feast on their own when they have exhausted their utility. We have listened as they have plotted and schemed to destroy our world."},
    [21311]={name="Earth Warder's Vest",quality=2,ilvl=48,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Timbermaw Ally'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Felwood. Objective: Grazle wants you to prove yourself by killing 5 Deadwood Warriors, 5 Deadwood Pathfinders, and 5 Deadwood Gardeners.",zone="Felwood",questName="Timbermaw Ally",lore="The Timbermaw are the only furbolg tribe to escape the corruption. However, many other races kill furbolg blindly now, without bothering to see if they are friend or foe."},
    [21312]={name="Belt of the Den Watcher",quality=2,ilvl=48,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Timbermaw Ally'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Felwood. Objective: Grazle wants you to prove yourself by killing 5 Deadwood Warriors, 5 Deadwood Pathfinders, and 5 Deadwood Gardeners.",zone="Felwood",questName="Timbermaw Ally",lore="The Timbermaw are the only furbolg tribe to escape the corruption. However, many other races kill furbolg blindly now, without bothering to see if they are friend or foe."},
    [21316]={name="Leggings of the Ursa",quality=2,ilvl=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Deadwood of the North'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Timbermaw Hold",questName="Deadwood of the North",lore="There is a camp of Deadwood furbolgs directly to our southwest. Corruption permeates the camp, and I wish to put an end to it before they become a problem."},
    [21317]={name="Helm of the Pathfinder",quality=2,ilvl=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Deadwood of the North'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Timbermaw Hold",questName="Deadwood of the North",lore="There is a camp of Deadwood furbolgs directly to our southwest. Corruption permeates the camp, and I wish to put an end to it before they become a problem."},
    [21318]={name="Earth Warder's Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=58,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Winterfall Activity'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Salfa in Winterspring. Objective: Salfa wants you to kill 8 Winterfall Shaman, 8 Winterfall Den Watchers, and 8 Winterfall Ursa. Salfa is located just outside the entrance to Timbermaw Hold in Winterspring.",zone="Timbermaw Hold",questName="Winterfall Activity",lore="The Timbermaw tend to stay to themselves. While we do allow safe passage to those we trust, we try to avoid other furbolg tribes if at all possible."},
    [21322]={name="Ursa's Embrace",quality=2,ilvl=58,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Winterfall Activity'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Salfa in Winterspring. Objective: Salfa wants you to kill 8 Winterfall Shaman, 8 Winterfall Den Watchers, and 8 Winterfall Ursa. Salfa is located just outside the entrance to Timbermaw Hold in Winterspring.",zone="Timbermaw Hold",questName="Winterfall Activity",lore="The Timbermaw tend to stay to themselves. While we do allow safe passage to those we trust, we try to avoid other furbolg tribes if at all possible."},
    [21387]={name="Avenger's Crown",quality=4,ilvl=81,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Avenger's Crown'. Starts with Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. Objective: Bring Vek'lor's Diadem, 2 Idols of Rebirth, 5 Stone Scarabs and 5 Crystal Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Avenger's Crown",lore="The Twin Emperors... their incessant whispers are slowly taking a toll on my sanity. They mock me, knowing I cannot step further into their domain to save my brother Arygos."},
    [21388]={name="Avenger's Greaves",quality=4,ilvl=78,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Avenger's Greaves'. Starts with Kandrostrasz in Ahn'Qiraj. Objective: Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Dominance, 2 Idols of the Sage, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Clay Scarabs to Kandrostrasz in Ahn'Qiraj. This quest also requires Neutral faction with the Brood of Nozdormu.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Avenger's Greaves",lore="Qiraji magic is strong and ancient. The most powerful qiraji wield items of such might, they'd give pause even to a dragon."},
    [21389]={name="Avenger's Breastplate",quality=4,ilvl=88,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Avenger's Breastplate'. Starts with Vethsera in Ahn'Qiraj. Objective: Bring the the Carapace of the Old God, 2 Idols of the Sage, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Vethsera inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Honored reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Avenger's Breastplate",lore="The unmentionable Old God slowly awakens from his slumber beneath Ahn'Qiraj. The terrible fate that awaits Azeroth could come in days or years; time has no meaning for beings of his power."},
    [21390]={name="Avenger's Legguards",quality=4,ilvl=81,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Avenger's Legguards'. Starts with Kandrostrasz in Ahn'Qiraj. Objective: Bring the Skin of the Great Sandworm, 2 Idols of Strife, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Ivory Scarabs to Kandrostrasz inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Avenger's Legguards",lore="You seek to prove your worth to my kind, mortal? Very well, perhaps we can be of mutual assistance. The ancient sandworm, Ouro, is a being of legendary power."},
    [21391]={name="Avenger's Pauldrons",quality=4,ilvl=78,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Avenger's Pauldrons'. Starts with Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. Objective: Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Dominance, 2 Idols of Life, 5 Crystal Scarabs and 5 Gold Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Neutral reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Avenger's Pauldrons",lore="Bring me the bindings worn by the highest Qiraji leaders and I shall shape them into a set of pauldrons more dreadful than even the wings of Nefarian himself!"},
    [21395]={name="Blade of Eternal Justice",quality=4,ilvl=70,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Blade of Eternal Justice'. Starts with Warden Haro in Silithus. Objective: Bring 1 Qiraji Spiked Hilt, 2 Amber Idols, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Ivory Scarabs to Warden Haro in Silithus. You must also attain Exalted reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Blade of Eternal Justice",lore="The Qiraji and their servants wield items made with the rarest and finest materials: bones from gargantuan ancient creatures, gems from the depths of the earth, metals pure and strong."},
    [21396]={name="Ring of Eternal Justice",quality=4,ilvl=65,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Ring of Eternal Justice'. Starts with Windcaller Yessendra in Silithus. Objective: Bring 1 Qiraji Magisterial Ring, 2 Vermillion Idols, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Windcaller Yessendra in Silithus. You must also attain Honored reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Ring of Eternal Justice",lore="The gems that adorn Qiraji idols would work quite well, as their quality is superior. Bring me the ring and idols and I'll create a powerful ring for you."},
    [21397]={name="Cape of Eternal Justice",quality=4,ilvl=67,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Cape of Eternal Justice'. Starts with Keyl Swiftclaw in Silithus. Objective: Bring 1 Qiraji Regal Drape, 2 Obsidian Idols, 5 Gold Scarabs and 5 Clay Scarabs to Keyl Swiftclaw in Silithus. You must also obtain Revered reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Cape of Eternal Justice",lore="I'm glad to hear you're aiding us in our attack on Ahn'Qiraj. I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy."},
    [21453]={name="Mantle of the Horusath",quality=4,ilvl=72,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ossirian the Unscarred.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Ossirian the Unscarred",lore="A qiraji lieutenant holding the Ruins, whose name stopped being accurate the first time a raid used the crystals against him."},
    [21468]={name="Mantle of Maz'Nadir",quality=3,ilvl=74,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Moam.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Moam",lore="A stone giant pressed into qiraji service, who drains the mana of everyone fighting him and turns to rock when full."},
    [21475]={name="Legplates of the Destroyer",quality=3,ilvl=74,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Moam.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Moam",lore="A stone giant pressed into qiraji service, who drains the mana of everyone fighting him and turns to rock when full."},
    [21477]={name="Ring of Fury",quality=3,ilvl=74,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Moam.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Moam",lore="A stone giant pressed into qiraji service, who drains the mana of everyone fighting him and turns to rock when full."},
    [21481]={name="Boots of the Desert Protector",quality=3,ilvl=73,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ayamiss the Hunter.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Ayamiss the Hunter"},
    [21484]={name="Helm of Regrowth",quality=3,ilvl=73,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ayamiss the Hunter.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Ayamiss the Hunter"},
    [21486]={name="Gloves of the Swarm",quality=4,ilvl=68,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Buru the Gorger.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Buru the Gorger"},
    [21495]={name="Legplates of the Qiraji Command",quality=3,ilvl=71,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from General Rajaxx.",zone="The Scarab Wall",npc="General Rajaxx",lore="Commander of the qiraji army, who threw wave after wave at the Scarab Wall in the War of the Shifting Sands and came back to do it again."},
    [21496]={name="Bracers of Qiraji Command",quality=3,ilvl=71,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from General Rajaxx.",zone="The Scarab Wall",npc="General Rajaxx",lore="Commander of the qiraji army, who threw wave after wave at the Scarab Wall in the War of the Shifting Sands and came back to do it again."},
    [21504]={name="Charm of the Shifting Sands",quality=4,ilvl=70,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Fall of Ossirian'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Objective: Deliver the Head of Ossirian the Unscarred to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",questName="The Fall of Ossirian",lore="A terrible menace has been laid to rest. The cruel Ossirian has been vanquished. The denizens of Kalimdor would be relieved to know of this victory."},
    [21505]={name="Choker of the Shifting Sands",quality=4,ilvl=70,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Fall of Ossirian'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Objective: Deliver the Head of Ossirian the Unscarred to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",questName="The Fall of Ossirian",lore="A terrible menace has been laid to rest. The cruel Ossirian has been vanquished. The denizens of Kalimdor would be relieved to know of this victory."},
    [21506]={name="Pendant of the Shifting Sands",quality=4,ilvl=70,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Fall of Ossirian'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Objective: Deliver the Head of Ossirian the Unscarred to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",questName="The Fall of Ossirian",lore="A terrible menace has been laid to rest. The cruel Ossirian has been vanquished. The denizens of Kalimdor would be relieved to know of this victory."},
    [21507]={name="Amulet of the Shifting Sands",quality=4,ilvl=70,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Fall of Ossirian'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Objective: Deliver the Head of Ossirian the Unscarred to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",questName="The Fall of Ossirian",lore="A terrible menace has been laid to rest. The cruel Ossirian has been vanquished. The denizens of Kalimdor would be relieved to know of this victory."},
    [21520]={name="Ravencrest's Legacy",quality=4,ilvl=76,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Treasure of the Timeless One'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Jonathan the Revelator in Silithus. Objective: Greetings, champion. I am Jonathan, keeper of the sacred gong and eternal watcher of the Bronze Flight.I have been empowered by the Timeless One himself to grant you an item of your choosing from his timeless treasure trove. May it aid you in your battles against C'Thun.",zone="Silithus",questName="Treasure of the Timeless One"},
    [21521]={name="Runesword of the Red",quality=4,ilvl=76,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Treasure of the Timeless One'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Jonathan the Revelator in Silithus. Objective: Greetings, champion. I am Jonathan, keeper of the sacred gong and eternal watcher of the Bronze Flight.I have been empowered by the Timeless One himself to grant you an item of your choosing from his timeless treasure trove. May it aid you in your battles against C'Thun.",zone="Silithus",questName="Treasure of the Timeless One"},
    [21531]={name="Drake Tooth Necklace",quality=4,ilvl=77,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Nightmare Manifests'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Keeper Remulos in Moonglade. Objective: Defend Nighthaven from Eranikus. Do not let Keeper Remulos perish. Do not slay Eranikus. Defend yourself. Await Tyrande.",zone="Moonglade",questName="The Nightmare Manifests",lore="We must use restraint against Eranikus. We are to redeem him not destroy him. Tyrande is already en route to assist us in this task. We must weather the dragon's blows and save Nighthaven from certain destruction."},
    [21532]={name="Drudge Boots",quality=4,ilvl=77,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Nightmare Manifests'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Keeper Remulos in Moonglade. Objective: Defend Nighthaven from Eranikus. Do not let Keeper Remulos perish. Do not slay Eranikus. Defend yourself. Await Tyrande.",zone="Moonglade",questName="The Nightmare Manifests",lore="We must use restraint against Eranikus. We are to redeem him not destroy him. Tyrande is already en route to assist us in this task. We must weather the dragon's blows and save Nighthaven from certain destruction."},
    [21563]={name="Don Rodrigo's Band",quality=4,ilvl=65,reqLevel=60,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Gaelden Hammersmith.",zone="Alterac Valley",npc="Gaelden Hammersmith"},
    [21567]={name="Rune of Duty",quality=3,ilvl=45,reqLevel=40,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from the Warsong Gulch quartermaster with marks of honor. Alliance: Illiyana Moonblaze at Silverwing Grove, Ashenvale. Horde: Kelm Hargunth at Mor'shan Base Camp, The Barrens."},
    [21568]={name="Rune of Duty",quality=3,ilvl=25,reqLevel=20,sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from the Warsong Gulch quartermaster with marks of honor. Alliance: Illiyana Moonblaze at Silverwing Grove, Ashenvale. Horde: Kelm Hargunth at Mor'shan Base Camp, The Barrens."},
    [21581]={name="Gauntlets of Annihilation",quality=4,ilvl=88,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from C'Thun.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="C'Thun",lore="An Old God, buried under Ahn'Qiraj by the titans rather than killed. It has been whispering to the qiraji ever since, and the whole war exists because it never stopped."},
    [21583]={name="Cloak of Clarity",quality=4,ilvl=88,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from C'Thun.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="C'Thun",lore="An Old God, buried under Ahn'Qiraj by the titans rather than killed. It has been whispering to the qiraji ever since, and the whole war exists because it never stopped."},
